# ILSAArticleMetadata pipeline

When you change `ILSAArticleMetadata`, `DataBlock`, sanitize rules, or validation logic:

1. Read skill: `.cursor/skills/ilsa-metadata-pipeline/SKILL.md`
2. Run: `bash scripts/run_ilsa_metadata_pipeline.sh --no-git` (add push only if user asks)
3. On-disk JSON must pass `validate_public_article_json()` before commit

Do not skip resanitize → Excel → taxonomy order. API extraction scripts are separate.
